际馀霞似残锦，只堪收拾饷丘迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64564,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋十绝 其五","author":"葛胜仲","text":"两士端如萧子显，求心已足不干名。\n春朝秋夕风兼月，辞藻居然嗜此生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64565,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋十绝 其六","author":"葛胜仲","text":"云篷烟艇寄孤高，破浪乘风不碍桥。\n岂待征夫问归路，始教轻漾日遥遥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64566,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋十绝 其七","author":"葛胜仲","text":"眺望云岩每惜归，溶溶溪练照斜晖。\n双凫容与还如我，因恋沧洲更不飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64567,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋十绝 其八","author":"葛胜仲","text":"清新十咏岂才疏，俗韵芜词尽扫除。\n佳句浪传真可惜，郊居斋壁莫轻书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64568,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋十绝 其九","author":"葛胜仲","text":"软语相从喜道林，碧流紫树日幽寻。\n是非那复谈朝士，懒作香方比麝沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64569,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋十绝 其十","author":"葛胜仲","text":"蜡珠作凤定非真，真凤惟梧与竹亲。\n凤去台空应不恨，赋诗同有谪仙人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64570,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其一","author":"葛胜仲","text":"洞府桃花出汎泉，只容刘阮见飞仙。\n丛条叠颖嫌逋客，好去人间莫浪传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64571,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其二","author":"葛胜仲","text":"不甘蒿藋蔽流溪，混沌何妨一画眉。\n若遣周回插杨柳，醴泉便是陆家池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64572,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其三","author":"葛胜仲","text":"隐吏皆非谩诲潜，夜灯花落广文檐。\n招寻月月携连璧，不用船中觅孝廉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64573,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其四","author":"葛胜仲","text":"屈曲云根屋旋移，下窥鸳瓦碧参差。\n不须欲速求儳路，自地升天理合迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64574,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其五","author":"葛胜仲","text":"云巘回环出远青，千层万叠莫知名。\n白茅峰独如黄宪，不见须臾鄙吝生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64575,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其六","author":"葛胜仲","text":"催功下下与高高，束火人归闹小桥。\n莫向九岩生妄见，须知采柏望中遥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64576,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其七","author":"葛胜仲","text":"滩声留客不容归，更尽西山一寸晖。\n要看冰轮升紫磨，绕枝寒鹊自惊飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64577,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其八","author":"葛胜仲","text":"秋残景物更萧疏，愁寄忧埋尽破除。\n埃壒是中无少分，昼尘终恐误君书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64578,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其九","author":"葛胜仲","text":"闻有山房隐茂林，高人不与世相寻。\n屋虚但有荒基在，恐是宜僚遁陆沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64579,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"走笔再和凤凰山十韵酬良器解元兼呈文中宣德 其十","author":"葛胜仲","text":"结友忘怀契道真，水云情话似亲亲。\n爱君叶落云飞句，知是才高压众人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64580,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送灵浩赴江州般若之请三首 其一","author":"葛胜仲","text":"甚深真谛不容声，溢水炉峰照坐明。\n悟般若人居般若，钟鱼都是妙香城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64581,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送灵浩赴江州般若之请三首 其二","author":"葛胜仲","text":"岘山峰顶五花堂，曾见迷津赖法航。\n霅水江流同一滴，未妨作